# camera: USB cameras (UVC). QEMU has none, so this checks the empty case;
# the descriptor parser and picture assembly are tested in beenet/src/uvc.rs.
$ camera
no camera (USB video class) plugged in; 'lsusb' lists the devices
$ camera raw
no camera plugged in
$ lsusb
~ xHCI|no USB controller
$ camera snap /me.jpg
camera: no camera plugged in ('lsusb' lists the devices)
$ camera record /me.avi 5
camera: no camera plugged in ('lsusb' lists the devices)
$ camera record /me.gif 5
usage: camera record FILE.avi SECONDS   (1 to 600; Ctrl+C stops early)
$ camera snap /me.jpg big
usage: camera snap FILE [WIDTHxHEIGHT]
